{"id":"0dd5fa36b013f76e","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-reverse-mathematics.md","title":"Reversal over a Base Theory","display":"df-reverse-mathematics — Reversal over a Base Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-reverse-mathematics","aliases":["62-df-reverse-mathematics"],"display":"df-reverse-mathematics — Reversal over a Base Theory","depends_on":["[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.9","source_pages":[32,33,34],"source_pdf_pages":[50,51,52]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-reverse-mathematics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-reverse-mathematics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reverse-mathematics — Reversal over a Base Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.9"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>32</span><span>33</span><span>34</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span><span>51</span><span>52</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\">\\(T_0,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\">\\(\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reverse\\text{-}mathematics}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Reversal}_{S_2}(T,\\varphi;T_0)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(T,\\{\\varphi\\};T_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reverse\\text{-}mathematics}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Reversal}_{S_2}(T,\\varphi;T_0)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(T,\\{\\varphi\\};T_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本目录将书中逆向数学方法关系化的辅助定义。两方向分别要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0+T\">\\(T_0+T\\)</span> 证明数学原则、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0+\\varphi\">\\(T_0+\\varphi\\)</span> 恢复 T 的公理。T 可以是模式，φ 必须是句子；自由参数先全称关闭。典型基理论为 RCA₀，但本定义不将基理论硬编码。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），§I.9；纸面页 32, 33, 34；PDF 页 50, 51, 52。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_0,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}$，见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_0,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}$，见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T_0,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reverse\\text{-}mathematics}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Reversal}_{S_2}(T,\\varphi;T_0)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(T,\\{\\varphi\\};T_0).","display":true},{"tex":"T_0+T","display":false},{"tex":"T_0+\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1267,"backlinks":[{"id":"60fb71c52244db74","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T_0\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}$，见 [[62-df-L2]]；$\\operatorname{Reversal}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-reverse-mathematics]]。以下有序对是元层集合论有序对。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-reverse-mathematics|Reversal over a Base Theory]]"}],"outgoing":["781620ab41bfeebd","4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}